subckt dut (VSS voc1 voc2)
Cf (net6 net4) capacitor c=1p
Cin (net6 net0) capacitor c=1p
CT1 (net8 VSS) capacitor c=1p
CT2 (net7 VSS) capacitor c=1p
CT3 (net0 VSS) capacitor c=1p
G1 (net4 net0 net6 net0) vccs gm=1m
M1 (voc2 net1 net7 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
Q1 (voc1 net2 net8 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__npn_05v5_W1p00L1p00 m=1
Rin (net6 net0) resistor r=1k
RL1 (VSS voc1) resistor r=1k
RL2 (VSS voc2) resistor r=1k
RL3 (net4 VSS) resistor r=1k
RS1 (net3 net2) resistor r=1k
RS2 (net9 net1) resistor r=1k
RS3 (net10 net5) resistor r=1k
RT1 (net8 VSS) resistor r=1k
RT2 (net7 VSS) resistor r=1k
RT3 (net0 VSS) resistor r=1k
Rx (net5 net6) resistor r=1k
V1 (net3 VSS) vsource dc=1
V2 (net9 VSS) vsource dc=1
V3 (net10 VSS) vsource dc=1
